  (text "DNP -- ordered, never connected. Decide its position NOW:\nthe shunt sits in series with the pack lead, so retrofitting\nmeans cutting the harness you are about to make.\nR002 (0.002 ohm), NOT R100 -- R100 is good for 0.8 A and this\nrig pulls ~3 A. 3V3 only, never 5 V, or the module's I2C\npull-ups put 5 V on GPIO2/GPIO3." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 218.44 182.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "7937f277-4f0e-542d-af00-5e6d74377de9"))
