  (text "A1/A2 must be the two ends of ONE coil, B1/B2 the two ends of the\nother. Cross them and the motor buzzes, heats and does not turn.\nWhich way round a pair goes only reverses direction, and direction\nis a software setting (TLSPIE_DIR_FORWARD) -- do not chase it with\na soldering iron. Find the pairs with a meter on continuity,\nmotor disconnected: one coil reads a few ohms, the other open." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 294.64 308.635 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "d33d381b-72ab-5ec5-b43c-faa5e6abd302"))
  (text "ZONE C   CAPTURE, CLOCK, COOLING      unchanged from Rev 2.0" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 386.08 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "90bcddd0-3899-51de-baed-be3c0b8cc750"))
